{"title":"Gravewrap Torso","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 56) · Monster drop: Young Red Dragon, The Pale Hart, Rimewing, Ogre Charger, Ogre Elder +4 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 56 <span class=\"muted\">(7266 XP)</span> from 2× <a href=\"#/item/burial-wrappings\">Burial Wrappings</a>, 8× <a href=\"#/item/wool\">Wool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"pale-hart\" title=\"The Pale Hart - dropped it in 1 of 5 looted corpses (1/5)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e2e0b9d15c65806fed4f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Pale Hart</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/5<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"rimewing\" title=\"Rimewing - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/8c3a3c351144b327cb83.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Rimewing</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"lantern-eater\" title=\"The Lantern Eater - dropped it in 1 of 7 looted corpses (1/7)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c92787d8673dbae51c75.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">The Lantern Eater</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/7<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-youth\" title=\"Ogre Youth - dropped it in 1 of 138 looted corpses (1/138)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/8fe05349771531a800b3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Youth</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/138<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\"